[{:db/id 17592186073735 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-30f78782-46a8-5fef-93fa-62c3bc5d1001" "question-348bf862-0000-5608-8f25-158f815d9723" "question-94b6267e-404d-5206-b721-940a636b7569" "question-0ff410a3-0c6f-5988-88a5-79160a3d1565" "question-fa02dad0-56c6-5504-ac96-8894e78cb09f"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073450 :question/worked-solution "We can express the ratio of the number of pentagons to the total number of shapes as follows:\n\n$$\n\\textrm{number of pentagons} : \\textrm{total number of shapes}\n$$\n\nTo find this ratio, we start by counting the number of occurrences of each shape:\n\n- First, we count the number of pentagons. There are $3$ pentagons.\n\n- Next, we count the total number of shapes. There are $6$ shapes.\n\nTherefore, the ratio of pentagons to total shapes is $3:6.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073736 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-e473c68b-cf42-5029-bb25-6a6af2c13e5a" "question-e2300841-eb93-50ec-a81c-b69a7df78772" "question-918c0ed9-8664-5aaa-af07-0b9b79fff05b" "question-a57c2b2f-5eb9-5b18-919a-0a3e3924e394" "question-342633b7-0af2-5736-9e7c-f7ff7859c8c8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073451 :question/worked-solution "We can express the ratio of the number of green crates to the total number of crates as follows:\n\n$$\n\\textrm{number of green crates} : \\textrm{total number of crates}\n$$\n\nWe compute our ratio as follows:\n\n- First, we count the number of green crates. There are $5$ green crates.\n\n- Next, we count the total number of crates. There are $8+5 = 13$ crates.\n\nTherefore, the ratio of green crates to total crates is $5:13.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073737 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-02447e62-a41a-5aec-b911-74025102ad42" "question-86a8860d-3cfb-576b-a5c9-f9833c8b5308" "question-1f1c065d-26db-5359-ab36-7049627505ee" "question-c0762ea5-0707-5974-8961-e278eb0de7ad"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073452 :question/problem "The ratio of red marbles to blue marbles in a  bag is $7:8.$ What is the meaning of this ratio?" :question/worked-solution "If the ratio of red marbles to blue marbles is ${\\color{red}{7}}:{\\color{blue}{8}},$ it means that there are ${\\color{red}{7}}$ red marbles for every ${\\color{blue}{8}}$ blue marbles." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-30f78782-46a8-5fef-93fa-62c3bc5d1001" :question/id #uuid "30f78782-46a8-5fef-93fa-62c3bc5d1001" :question/math-academy-id "q-70132" :question/problem "![](images/ea/eab3931ef4d46de23144f52420557e790a7e041231fec22d6819891e8e92ab16.png)\n\nWhat ratio describes the number of hexagons to pentagons?" :question/worked-solution "We can express the ratio of the number of hexagons to the number of pentagons as follows:\n\n$$\n\\text{number of hexagons}:\\text{number of pentagons}\n$$\n\nTo find this ratio, we start by counting the number of occurrences of each shape:\n\n- First, we count the number of hexagons. There are $2$ hexagons.\n\n- Next, we count the number of pentagons. There are $3$ pentagons.\n\nTherefore, the ratio of hexagons to pentagons is $2:3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dbc0948d-299a-5589-9b44-8aaa5970b041"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dbc0948d-299a-5589-9b44-8aaa5970b041" :answer-field/id #uuid "dbc0948d-299a-5589-9b44-8aaa5970b041" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b22cc36c-f580-5ab5-9409-ef6f11721994" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7fa16de3-c96a-532a-9d52-5b14d6061edd" "answer-b22cc36c-f580-5ab5-9409-ef6f11721994" "answer-3a497dcf-c546-5bfe-b3f0-5b5c87585083" "answer-091970d9-19e9-5c8f-9d4c-37f6882cad35" "answer-4f589ac5-bc24-593f-b37d-f2e5a1dcae40"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7fa16de3-c96a-532a-9d52-5b14d6061edd" :answer/id #uuid "7fa16de3-c96a-532a-9d52-5b14d6061edd